+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+ * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the b12x project
+ * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project
+ *
+ * The direct loader's native helper (--load-format direct): O_DIRECT reads of
+ * safetensors headers and metadata (_direct.c), and the batch executor that reads
+ * checkpoint ranges through a registered host ring into CUDA tensors (_batch.c,
+ * _bounce.c). One translation unit; _native.py builds it with the system compiler.
+ *
+ * Ported from local-inference-lab/b12x b12x/loader/_storage.c at 236ddff04a5f
+ * (Apache-2.0). Changed: the module is _direct_io_storage, and the PLE reader
+ * (_ple_reader.c) and its methods are gone.
